# Legal pages

Each app is a folder next to `taco/`, `ibge/`, `loterias/`.

Required files:

- `{slug}/index.html` — hub with disclaimer + cards
- `{slug}/privacy.html` — PT (`#politica-de-privacidade`) then EN (`#privacy-policy`); DiningXP also FR (`#politique-de-confidentialite`)
- `{slug}/terms.html` — PT (`#termos-e-condicoes`) then EN (`#terms-and-conditions`); DiningXP also FR (`#conditions-d-utilisation`)

Also add a card on the root `index.html` and a line in `README.md`.

Chrome: `../style.css`, header with site link, `main.doc` on legal pages, lang nav, footer year script. Do not inline CSS.

Contact: `rodrigo.scroferneker@gmail.com`. Date both languages the same day.

To add a new app, follow `.cursor/skills/add-app-legal/SKILL.md` (copy `_templates/app/`).
